---
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-surface-light to-surface-lavender/30">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">
    <div class="mb-12" data-gsap="fade-up">
      <p class="text-text-secondary text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Explore</p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-text-primary">
        How do you define the Key Data?
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Persona columns -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8" data-gsap="stagger-children">
      <!-- Personal Account -->
      <div class="bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Personal account</h3>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="w-1 h-8 rounded-full bg-blob-lavender"></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-secondary uppercase tracking-wide">Behavior</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="text-sm text-text-secondary space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li>Sharing life 1-2 times a week</li>
              <li>Login and stay time are not fixed</li>
              <li>Care about reading rate and user reading behavior</li>
              <li>Hope articles will be promoted to more people</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <hr class="border-dashed border-black/10" />

          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="w-1 h-8 rounded-full bg-blob-lavender"></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-secondary uppercase tracking-wide">Pain Points</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="text-sm text-text-secondary space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li>Comprehensive understanding of reading data</li>
              <li>More recommendations and readings</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <hr class="border-dashed border-black/10" />

          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="w-1 h-8 rounded-full bg-blob-lavender"></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-secondary uppercase tracking-wide">Data Demands</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-text-primary">Posts, Reads, Likes, Collects…</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Team Account -->
      <div class="bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Team account</h3>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="w-1 h-8 rounded-full bg-blob-lavender"></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-secondary uppercase tracking-wide">Behavior</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="text-sm text-text-secondary space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li>Division of labor, clear topic selection, detailed schedule</li>
              <li>Personnel specifically responsible for operations</li>
              <li>Push for merchant promotion, care about reading & sharing data</li>
              <li>Carefully read and reply during activities, some articles rewarded</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <hr class="border-dashed border-black/10" />

          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="w-1 h-8 rounded-full bg-blob-lavender"></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-secondary uppercase tracking-wide">Pain Points</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="text-sm text-text-secondary space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li>Understand data performance of articles and accounts</li>
              <li>Get more traffic and exposure</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <hr class="border-dashed border-black/10" />

          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="w-1 h-8 rounded-full bg-blob-lavender"></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-secondary uppercase tracking-wide">Data Demands</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-text-primary">Fans, Shares, Rewards…</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Official Account -->
      <div class="bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Official account</h3>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="w-1 h-8 rounded-full bg-blob-lavender"></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-secondary uppercase tracking-wide">Behavior</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="text-sm text-text-secondary space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li>Certain number of people, duty system</li>
              <li>Don't care much about reading and fan data</li>
              <li>Attention to public opinion orientation of promotional content</li>
              <li>Mainly use editing and publishing without complex functions</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <hr class="border-dashed border-black/10" />

          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="w-1 h-8 rounded-full bg-blob-lavender"></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-secondary uppercase tracking-wide">Pain Points</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="text-sm text-text-secondary space-y-2 pl-4">
              <li>Quickly understand article communication data</li>
              <li>Pay attention to public feedback</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <hr class="border-dashed border-black/10" />

          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="w-1 h-8 rounded-full bg-blob-lavender"></div>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-secondary uppercase tracking-wide">Data Demands</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-text-primary">Reads, Shares, Interactions and Comments</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
